From 3d9458eeea17fb773108f555eed6b2694880ea4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wuekevin <wuekevin@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 07:30:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] webhook: optional HMAC-SHA256 signing
 (webhook.signing_secret)

Adds X-WK-Timestamp / X-WK-Signature to async webhooks and before_send callbacks when
webhook.signing_secret is set; unsigned (unchanged behaviour) otherwise.
